# NordVPN

These scripts are meant to easily set up NordVPN as a peer or an  
exit node.

## config.sh

``` config.sh
./bash/nord/config.sh <<mesh-nickname>>
```

``` exit_node.sh
./bash/nord/exit_node.sh <<mesh-nickname>>
```


## Peer names

mesh-hp
mesh-dell
mesh-tab8
mesh-pixel
mesh-raspberry

### RaspberryPi routing

The Raspberry Pi will be configured to be used as an exit-node for
other meshnet peers.

